WEBVTT

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.220
今天不要上班，咪养你。
No work today. I'll take care of you.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.480
啊对，今天休假。我忘关闹钟啦。
Oh, right. It's my day off. I forgot the alarm.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.240
你：乖宝过来，先给我亲一口
You: Come here, baby, give me a kiss first.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:26.980
咪不亲亲，摸头就好。
One kiss? Mii accepts a head pat instead.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:36.170
咪上班了，先摆拖鞋。
Mii is on duty. Slippers first.

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:39.230
这只要朝这里。咪本来就知道。
This one faces here. Mii knew.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.840
你：夸咪摆得真好
You: Praise Mi, it's arranged so nicely

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:48.760
咪知道。它本来就是直的。
Mii knew. It was always straight.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:50.270
咪试了下果酱。用爪试的。
Mii tested the jam. With a paw.

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:52.880
不是故意的。
Not on purpose.

00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:00.440
你：你偷吃果酱了对不对？爪子给我看看
You: You stole the jam, didn't you? Let me see your paws

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:02.810
咪没有吃。
Mii did not eat it.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:09.190
只是试了试，没吃。
Only tested. Not eaten.

00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:12.730
咪去买新果酱，很快回来。
Mii will buy new jam. Back soon.

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:18.040
你：你一只小猫怎么买？有钱吗？
You: How does a little cat buy things? Do you have money?

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:20.070
咪有钱。大概。
Mii has money. Probably.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:28.010
你乖乖休息。咪很快回来。
You rest. Mii will be back soon.

00:01:33.140 --> 00:01:35.640
你：夸咪很会过日子
You: Praise Mi for being so good at managing life

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:39.420
咪知道的。咪很会过日子。
Mii knew. Mii is good at this.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:45.250
酱粘住了。它好像特别舍不得这个锅。
The sauce stuck. It loves this pot.

00:01:45.650 --> 00:01:49.750
第二回合。这次咪听话。
Round two. Mii listens this time.

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:53.240
你：没事，不急，咪慢慢来，我想看你颠锅
You: It's okay, no rush. Take your time, Mi. I want to watch you flip the pan

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:55.370
第二回合。这次咪听话。
Round two. Mii listens this time.

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:05.520
没粘住。你看？咪本来就知道。
Not stuck. See? Mii knew.

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:10.840
你：张嘴等咪喂一口
You: Open your mouth and wait for Mi to feed you a bite

00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:13.660
张嘴吧，咪准备好了。
Open wide. Mii is ready.

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:20.840
小小一口。咪吹了两遍。
Tiny bite. Mii blew on it twice.

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:22.560
味道如何？
How is it?

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:28.440
你：好吃好吃，还想吃，再喂我一口
You: Yummy, so yummy, I want more. Feed me another bite

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:30.590
咪：咪本来就知道。第二口，来了。
Mii knew. Second bite. Coming.

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:41.560
咪：就看一个。给咪的小脑袋放个假。
Just one video. Mii's brain needs a break.

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:46.040
你：你在看什么？给我也看看
You: What are you looking at? Let me see too

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:49.560
只是看个视频。小短腿，很重要的。
Just a video. Tiny legs. Very important.

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:53.970
你看它的小短腿！
Look at its tiny legs!

00:02:54.370 --> 00:03:00.390
玩一局吗？咪会一招。
One round? Mii knows one move.
